, 634220e9fcf912dd0f4c1fbc7400bdb5fb2999fe\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon RX 6700 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.21030.2001) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.91 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nExpected: I don't expect `reload_scene_from_path` to ever switch scenes.\n\nActual results: When `reload_scene_from_path` is called, it will _sometimes_ switch the tab to the reloaded scene.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open the MRP.\n- Open scene1, scene2, and scene3.\n- In the sidebar, which should be open from the addon, there will be 4 buttons. Ignore the fourth; that's for a different issue.\n\n<img width=\"481\" height=\"237\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ed703976-433d-4b9c-bfc0-35cd9909a8a4\" />\n\n- Try buttons 1, 2, and 3.\n- Note how, depending on which scene tab you have selected, `reload_scene_from_path` may or may not switch to the reloaded scene.\n\n<img width=\"463\" height=\"155\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d7f0ef73-4dd5-428b-9d43-313e49c3c60e\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[reload_scene_from_path_issues.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25616451/reload_scene_from_path_issues.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.g